Commercial use
==============

The terms below allow no commercial use. Using Mission Zero in or for a business,
running it for customers or installing it for anyone else requires a separate
commercial license from CRYPTOR.AGENCY (https://cryptor.agency). Under that license,
installation is reserved to CRYPTOR.AGENCY and to partners it approves in writing.
An installation without CRYPTOR.AGENCY's signed installation certificate carries no
warranty and no liability from CRYPTOR.AGENCY.

Earlier commits
===============

The commits of 26 and 27 October 2026, up to and including b558633, carry an MIT
license file left from a private skeleton. Those commits were never published nor
offered to anyone outside CRYPTOR.AGENCY under that file, which is withdrawn. This
repository, every commit of its history included, is published and offered only
under the terms of this file.

